# Material Symbols provenance

Official Google Material Symbols Rounded paths, imported without geometry edits from [google/material-design-icons](https://github.com/google/material-design-icons/tree/49d4db35df873165d6bd6ba09b063c7dafbac2f4). Revision: `49d4db35df873165d6bd6ba09b063c7dafbac2f4`. All use 24px optical size, weight 400, grade 0, fill 0. Compose scales and tints the source paths; no icon-font or shared dependency change is required.

Licensed under Apache-2.0; see [license](material-symbols-LICENSE.txt).

